# Container-only apt packages (devcontainers, `system-setup -p container`).
# Installed by: setup/modules/00-apt-base.sh (profile: container)
# Docs:         docs/setup/devcontainer.md
#
# Deliberately thin, like wsl.list: a container gets base.list plus these. No
# services, no drivers, no GUI — the host owns all of that.

# Editor: terminal-only Emacs build (see base.list, docs/setup/emacs.md)
emacs-nox
